@startuml FinReview_Collaboration
title FinReview Co. — Collaboration: one analytical review
skinparam shadowing false

together {
  class "Planner\n(OrchestratorAgent)" as Planner
  class "Specialist\n(Parser / Consistency / Ratio / Writer)" as Spec
  class "Calculator\n(ITool)" as Calc
  class "Language model\n(ILLMClient)" as LLM
  class "Approver\n(Practitioner)" as Appr
}

Planner --> Spec : 1: assign Task
Spec --> Calc : 2: invoke numeric tool
Calc --> Spec : 3: ToolResult
Spec --> LLM : 4: explain grounded in ToolResult
LLM --> Spec : 5: narrative
Spec --> Planner : 6: Finding + TaskResult
Planner --> Appr : 7: present draft / diff
Appr --> Planner : 8: confirm | dismiss | moreInfo | replan
Planner --> Spec : 9: patched WorkPlan (UC-08)

note right of Planner
  Collaboration roles, not extra classes:
  Planner, Specialist, Approver.
  Objects from the class diagram
  play these roles at runtime.
end note

@enduml
